he very bottom center of each user interface screen. Notwithstanding the above, the dimensions of the \"Powered By SugarCRM\" logo must be at least 106 x 23 pixels. When users click on the \"Powered by SugarCRM\" logo it must direct them back to http://www.sugarforge.org. In addition, the copyright notice must remain visible to all users at all times at the bottom of the user interface screen. When users click on the copyright notice, it must direct them back to http://www.sugarcrm.com",
